{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">醫務衞生局局長盧寵茂率領衞生署等官員，接種季節性流感疫苗。<br/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">盧寵茂聯同衞生署署長林文健等，在西灣河家庭醫學診所接種季節性流感疫苗。醫管局主席范鴻齡、醫管局行政總裁李夏茵等亦有一起接種。<br/></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.VACCINE-1230_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026t1SFQcxWe11788755806.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.VACCINE-1230_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">他們又同診所內的市民交流，鼓勵他們接種季節性流感疫苗。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">新一年度的流感疫苗接種計劃下周四展開，衞生署呼籲市民盡快接種流感疫苗，保障自己和家人健康。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.VACCINE-1230_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20265fel3vSoja1788755820.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.VACCINE-1230_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-07T04:59:32.389869+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}